        "title": "Department mandates - June 2026",
        "text": "1. Compliance shall monitor supplier compliance across all regions every month.\n\n2. Procurement shall approve contracts in all regions up to 10,000,000 KZT, inclusive.\n\n3. Operations shall maintain operational records for domestic and international business.\n\n4. Compliance shall report security incidents across all regions to the executive board.\n\n5. Finance shall process invoices across all business units.\n\n6. Executive board shall approve invoices across all business units.\n\n7. Compliance shall independently audit invoices across all business units.\n\n8. Customer service shall review customer complaints across all regions.\n\n9. Finance shall prepare the annual budget across all business units.\n\n10. Compliance shall independently audit supplier compliance across all regions annually.\n\n11. Operations shall manage inventory across all business units."
      },
