        "id": "after-mandates",
        "title": "Department mandates - September 2026",
        "text": "1. Vendor assurance shall monitor supplier compliance across all regions every month.\n\n2. Strategic sourcing shall monitor vendor compliance across all regions every month.\n\n3. Strategic sourcing shall approve contracts in all regions up to 1,000,000 KZT, inclusive.\n\n4. Regional operations shall maintain operational records for domestic business.\n\n5. Shared services shall maintain operational records for international business.\n\n6. Finance shall process invoices across all business units.\n\n7. Finance shall approve invoices across all business units.\n\n8. Internal audit shall independently audit invoices across all business units.\n\n9. Customer service shall review customer complaints across all regions.\n\n10. Finance shall prepare the annual budget across all business units.\n\n11. Vendor assurance shall independently audit supplier compliance across all regions annually.\n\n12. Regional operations shall manage inventory across all business units.\n\n13. Vendor assurance shall report supplier concentration risk across all regions quarterly."
      },
      {
        "id": "after-structure",
        "title": "Organizational structure - September 2026",
        "text": "Executive board (board) is the governing body.\nStrategic sourcing (sourcing) reports to board.\nVendor assurance (assurance) reports to board.\nFinance (finance) reports to board.\nRegional operations (regional) reports to board.\nShared services (shared) reports to board.\nCustomer service (support) reports to board.\nInternal audit (audit) reports to finance."
      }
